    "detailed_description": "<strong>Chromahertz is a colorful and dangerous bullet hell boss rush game. Weave and warp through patterns to evade and reflect bullets!</strong><br><br><i>The game is meant to be played with a mouse for maximum speed and technique. But there are gamepad and keyboard controls as well.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007590/extras/8b4e1e4c4f528cea50637c01b846e96f.poster.avif?t=1727480726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007590/extras/8b4e1e4c4f528cea50637c01b846e96f.webm?t=1727480726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007590/extras/8b4e1e4c4f528cea50637c01b846e96f.mp4?t=1727480726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 25+ Boss battles<br></li><li> Extra boss phases for skilled players<br></li><li> Mouse controls for one handed action.<br></li><li> Slow time to see hazards and set up attacks<br></li><li> Ranks and Leaderboards</li></ul><br>The hero, <strong>Dangers</strong>, loves order and safety. He's on a hunt for the man who hides in the deepest and darkest channels of the Chromahertz.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007590/extras/37c56b587f7b90dc2751425aa11ae7d7.avif?t=1727480726\" /></div><br><br>A man that loves horror and chaos, called <strong>Strangers</strong>. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007590/extras/cbbea3142b191095394eb8cd34f193f9.avif?t=1727480726\" /></div><br><br><strong>Help Dangers restore peace to the world!</strong>",
